window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Loving Stepdaddy: He is My Family Now</i>, is the story of a young woman who's lost her mother and the only family she has left is her stepfather. She goes to live with him on his ranch and finds that she wants to seduce him more than anything else in the world. As they grow closer her new man invites a friend over one night and she gains a lot more experience in the various ways to both please her men, and herself. </p>"; 
